tic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619220/extras/1294806567a019f499cd405d4d94d7d0.poster.avif?t=1721234839\" width=590 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619220/extras/1294806567a019f499cd405d4d94d7d0.webm?t=1721234839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619220/extras/1294806567a019f499cd405d4d94d7d0.mp4?t=1721234839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
